WEBVTT

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:39.978
Mareh 29, 1368
Koshu-Katsunuma

00:00:46.318 --> 00:00:47.527
Fire!

00:00:53.575 --> 00:00:54.576
Damn!

00:00:54.576 --> 00:00:56.411
Don't falter! Fire!

00:01:02.376 --> 00:01:03.585
Are you all right?

00:01:03.794 --> 00:01:05.420
I-I'm fine...

00:01:05.754 --> 00:01:06.838
Dammit...

00:01:06.838 --> 00:01:08.674
If this keeps up, we're going to be overrun.

00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:10.634
Sano!

00:01:11.468 --> 00:01:12.678
Over there!

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:14.471
Damn!

00:01:14.471 --> 00:01:16.306
They're trying to come around from the north?

00:01:33.699 --> 00:01:35.701
This place will become a battlefield soon.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:41.123
Flee to the safest place you can.

00:01:41.373 --> 00:01:45.377
| can't run and save myself while everyone is fighting.

00:01:47.671 --> 00:01:53.385
Then I order you, Chizuru Yukimura,
as a member of the Shinsengumi,

00:01:53.385 --> 00:01:55.595
to serve as Commander Kondou's bodyguard.

00:01:56.513 --> 00:01:58.932
Until I return with reinforcements,

00:01:58.932 --> 00:02:01.893
stay with the commander at all times and assist him.

00:02:01.893 --> 00:02:03.312
R-right!

00:02:03.854 --> 00:02:08.650
I, Chizuru Yukimura, as the attendant of
Vice Commander Hijikata, will risk my life to-

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.068
No matter what, don't die!

00:02:11.111 --> 00:02:14.531
Don't let stupid ideas like
being his shield into your head.

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:18.035
If something happens before I return,

00:02:18.035 --> 00:02:21.038
work with Saito to get Kondou-san to safety.

00:02:21.496 --> 00:02:22.706
Hijikata-san...

00:02:23.373 --> 00:02:24.791
Remove your kodachi.

00:02:25.584 --> 00:02:28.795
Unsheath half of it, with the back facing me.

00:02:35.344 --> 00:02:38.972
Samurai do this when they swear an oath.

00:02:39.765 --> 00:02:41.391
It's an oath between samurai?

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:42.976
| vow to you:

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:47.564
You will survive and see me again.
That is our vow.

00:02:48.190 --> 00:02:53.820
Of course, neither of us are officially samurai,
so we're just copying them.

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:58.158
| leave the rest to you.

00:02:58.909 --> 00:03:00.327
Take care of Kondou-san.

00:03:10.253 --> 00:03:12.839
<i>Hakuoki
Demon of the Fleeting Blossom</i>

00:03:12.839 --> 00:03:20.680
Hakuoki Demon o the Fleeting
Blossom Warrio» Spirit of the Blue Sky

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:22.891
Commander!

00:03:23.767 --> 00:03:25.185
What is it, Saito-kun?

00:03:26.186 --> 00:03:28.397
The enemy is flooding in from the north.

00:03:28.397 --> 00:03:29.398
What?!

00:03:29.398 --> 00:03:30.816
From the south, too.

00:03:31.191 --> 00:03:32.401
Nagakura-san!

00:03:34.361 --> 00:03:35.487
Are you all right?

00:03:35.487 --> 00:03:36.696
Y-yeah...

00:03:38.365 --> 00:03:39.783
What shall we do, Kondou-san?

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.411
At this rate, it will become a pincer attack!

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.579
Who the hell are you?!

00:04:10.856 --> 00:04:11.857
What?!

00:04:12.149 --> 00:04:13.150
It couldn't be!

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.359
Furies?!

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.329
Kondou-san!

00:04:27.247 --> 00:04:28.457
Yukimura-kun?!

00:04:29.207 --> 00:04:31.835
Kondou-san, hurry!

00:04:49.561 --> 00:04:50.770
Harada-san!

00:04:51.146 --> 00:04:54.357
Why are furies moving around in broad daylight?

00:04:54.608 --> 00:04:55.817
| don't know...

00:04:56.067 --> 00:05:00.071
Kondou-san, we should retreat and reorganize!

00:05:01.364 --> 00:05:05.494
However, we came here under orders from the Bakufu.

00:05:05.494 --> 00:05:07.704
We can't have the audacity to turn back now.

00:05:08.455 --> 00:05:09.956
What are you saying?!

00:05:09.956 --> 00:05:11.374
Face reality!

00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:15.170
Further combat will just lead
to more meaningless sacrifice!

00:05:17.088 --> 00:05:18.673
Kondou-san...

00:05:18.673 --> 00:05:20.509
retreat isn't defeat.

00:05:21.968 --> 00:05:23.595
It's over...

00:05:24.095 --> 00:05:26.723
the era of waging war through courage.

00:05:38.318 --> 00:05:41.530
It seems furies have been thrust into this war.

00:05:42.822 --> 00:05:45.825
So that means that Satsuma,
who were skeptical of furies,

00:05:45.825 --> 00:05:50.205
accpeted Tosa's request,
since they let the Shinsengumi furies

00:05:50.205 --> 00:05:53.375
get away at Toba-Fushimi, huh?

00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:54.584
Right.

00:05:56.836 --> 00:05:59.673
Hasten the preparations to cut off
our relationship with Satsuma...

00:06:00.215 --> 00:06:04.511
and hurry with the arrangements to once more
hide our people from the humans.

00:06:04.511 --> 00:06:05.720
Understood.

00:06:12.185 --> 00:06:13.812
Chizuru Yukimura...

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:18.233
just how long do you intend
to concern yourself with humans?

00:06:25.865 --> 00:06:27.075
Kondou-san...

00:06:52.892 --> 00:06:55.103
Furies that can move during the day?

00:06:55.729 --> 00:06:57.939
Different from us then, huh?

00:06:58.398 --> 00:06:59.399
Yes...

00:06:59.649 --> 00:07:04.279
So Kodo-san's research has advanced that far, then?

00:07:04.988 --> 00:07:08.992
They came right for Kondou-san at Kofu.

00:07:10.160 --> 00:07:14.164
| want the three of you to take shifts,
acting as Kondou-san's bodyguards.

00:07:14.456 --> 00:07:15.498
Sir!

00:07:15.498 --> 00:07:16.708
Leave it to me!

00:07:25.425 --> 00:07:27.260
Hijikata-kun,

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:30.180
it seems you've been working
regardless of whether it's day or night.

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.598
Are you all right?

00:07:32.557 --> 00:07:34.559
You're also a fury.

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:38.563
This isn't the kind of situation to be
saying something like that.

00:07:40.315 --> 00:07:42.150
Now's the time to stand firm and persevere.

00:07:48.031 --> 00:07:49.658
| brought you breakfast.

00:07:50.992 --> 00:07:52.202
Hijikata-san?

00:07:53.244 --> 00:07:54.454
I'm opening the door.

00:08:14.015 --> 00:08:17.227
Um, you should rest a little.

00:08:17.769 --> 00:08:20.605
Right, once I'm done with this.

00:08:22.357 --> 00:08:25.360
But you said that last night as well...

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:31.700
Vice Commander...

00:08:32.617 --> 00:08:33.827
What is it?

00:08:34.285 --> 00:08:36.121
Commander Kondou is calling for you.

00:08:37.914 --> 00:08:39.124
Kondou-san is?

00:08:40.166 --> 00:08:41.584
Has something happened?

00:08:42.419 --> 00:08:43.628
Well...

00:08:50.051 --> 00:08:51.469
It seems you're serious.

00:08:53.054 --> 00:08:54.097
Yes...

00:08:54.097 --> 00:08:57.517
From here on out, I'll fight in my own way.

00:08:59.519 --> 00:09:01.354
Kondou-san, that's all right, isn't it?

00:09:03.148 --> 00:09:04.357
| understand.

00:09:05.442 --> 00:09:07.277
You as well, Harada?

00:09:09.154 --> 00:09:10.155
Yes...

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.618
Thank you for everything.

00:09:26.171 --> 00:09:28.173
Are you leaving no matter what?

00:09:28.757 --> 00:09:30.967
Well, we've got our reasons...

00:09:31.676 --> 00:09:35.889
| never want to think, "Man, I wish I'd done that."

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:39.309
What about you, Saito?

00:09:40.185 --> 00:09:43.396
| still have something here that I must do.

00:09:45.064 --> 00:09:46.274
Got it.

00:09:47.609 --> 00:09:51.029
Chizuru, I had wanted to protect you till the end.

00:09:51.404 --> 00:09:54.407
I'm sorry it looks like I'm abandoning
you before everything is resolved.

00:09:55.325 --> 00:09:56.534
Harada-san...

00:09:57.577 --> 00:09:59.412
But don't you forget,

00:09:59.412 --> 00:10:05.418
we'll still be fighting the same battles
somewhere out there under the same sky.

00:10:05.919 --> 00:10:07.545
That's right!

00:10:09.214 --> 00:10:12.425
We're still gonna be out fightin' them Satcho dogs!

00:10:12.759 --> 00:10:15.762
This ain't our final farewell!

00:10:17.931 --> 00:10:18.932
Right...

00:10:23.019 --> 00:10:24.854
You two take care!

00:10:26.189 --> 00:10:27.398
You too, Chizuru!

00:10:35.114 --> 00:10:39.744
Why didn't Hijikata-san stop them?

00:10:41.037 --> 00:10:45.041
The Vice Commander was the one
who wanted to stop those two the most.

00:10:47.377 --> 00:10:51.214
But everyone has something
they're not willing to concede.

00:10:52.131 --> 00:10:55.760
The Vice Commander's the one
who understands that best, as well.

00:11:01.391 --> 00:11:02.600
Let's head back.

00:11:03.142 --> 00:11:04.143
Right!

00:11:24.622 --> 00:11:25.832
Hey, Sano!

00:11:26.541 --> 00:11:27.542
Yeah!

00:11:57.572 --> 00:12:00.575
Please eat,
at least a little.

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:25.350
D-dammit, why now...

00:12:26.309 --> 00:12:27.518
Hijikata-san?

00:12:28.645 --> 00:12:30.063
Is something wrong?

00:12:30.438 --> 00:12:32.231
I-it's nothing.

00:12:32.231 --> 00:12:33.441
Go away!

00:12:36.527 --> 00:12:38.529
I'm sorry, but I'm coming in!

00:12:41.449 --> 00:12:42.659
Hijikata-san!

00:12:43.034 --> 00:12:44.243
Go away!

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:47.705
Don't come any closer!

00:12:48.623 --> 00:12:50.458
Do you need blood?

00:12:57.966 --> 00:12:59.968
St-stop!

00:13:01.094 --> 00:13:02.095
Why?

00:13:02.387 --> 00:13:04.597
Won't it calm down if you drink my blood?

00:13:04.597 --> 00:13:06.099
Be quiet!

00:13:06.099 --> 00:13:08.184
I'm fine, so hurry up and get out!

00:13:08.184 --> 00:13:09.185
But...

00:13:09.727 --> 00:13:10.937
Hijikata-san!

00:13:11.312 --> 00:13:12.730
| told you to leave!

00:13:25.326 --> 00:13:26.536
Hijikata-san...

00:13:29.872 --> 00:13:31.290
Don't worry...

00:13:34.377 --> 00:13:37.588
| won't give in to something like this...

00:14:19.922 --> 00:14:22.091
Bl-blood!

00:14:22.091 --> 00:14:24.510
Give me blood!

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:28.139
You are beyond reasoning with.

00:14:59.879 --> 00:15:00.880
What?!

00:15:01.798 --> 00:15:04.425
To think I would need your assistance.

00:15:12.141 --> 00:15:14.519
It's you, from the lkeda Inn!

00:15:14.519 --> 00:15:16.521
Please wait, Toudou-kun.

00:15:17.438 --> 00:15:20.274
Just who exactly are you?

00:15:20.775 --> 00:15:22.777
| am Kyuju Amagiri.

00:15:23.319 --> 00:15:27.115
In the capital, I clashed fists with you
without giving you my name,

00:15:27.115 --> 00:15:29.867
but I have no intention of starting something with you.

00:15:29.867 --> 00:15:30.868
What?

00:15:31.577 --> 00:15:32.995
Who was that fury?

00:15:33.704 --> 00:15:37.708
He was a Tosa Domain fury of Kodo Yukimura's making.

00:15:37.708 --> 00:15:39.544
A Tosa Domain fury?

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:46.551
| heard rumors that a fury had escaped
and was roaming Edo in search of blood.

00:15:47.051 --> 00:15:50.054
| had intended to eliminate him on sight, but...

00:15:50.763 --> 00:15:52.974
it seems he has already burned through his lifespan.

00:15:53.558 --> 00:15:54.767
His lifespan?

00:15:55.810 --> 00:16:00.022
A fury's power is by no means a gift from the gods.

00:16:00.731 --> 00:16:04.152
Extraordinary strength, agility,

00:16:04.318 --> 00:16:06.737
and miraculous healing abilities...

00:16:07.655 --> 00:16:10.867
Such powers are hidden within your own body.

00:16:11.993 --> 00:16:17.999
You are merely using it
spread over the course of several years.

00:16:19.876 --> 00:16:24.297
You all should be careful not to
use such power recklessly as well.

00:16:31.429 --> 00:16:32.638
| see...

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.558
So the power comes in exchange for your life.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:36.851
Yes.

00:16:37.852 --> 00:16:39.061
Okay...

00:16:40.229 --> 00:16:41.439
| understand.

00:16:41.689 --> 00:16:44.609
By the way, as for what we should do from here on out...

00:16:45.318 --> 00:16:48.362
we'll leave Edo before those Satcho bastards get here,

00:16:48.362 --> 00:16:49.572
and head towards Aizu.

00:16:50.281 --> 00:16:52.700
Saito, please take care of
the preparations for our departure.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:53.701
Understood.

00:16:54.493 --> 00:16:58.372
Sannan-san and Heisuke, go first
and head over there sometime tonight.

00:16:58.372 --> 00:16:59.373
Got it.

00:17:10.968 --> 00:17:12.178
I'm sorry.

00:17:12.678 --> 00:17:14.347
What is it, all of the sudden?

00:17:15.056 --> 00:17:16.766
If it weren't for me,

00:17:16.766 --> 00:17:21.103
you would never have gotten into a fight
like that with Kazama-san,

00:17:21.103 --> 00:17:22.521
and you wouldn't have become a fury.

00:17:23.147 --> 00:17:24.148
I---

00:17:25.107 --> 00:17:27.526
drank the Water of Life of my own free will.

00:17:31.864 --> 00:17:34.075
There's no reason for you to worry about it.

00:17:36.702 --> 00:17:39.789
You're always saying that, Hijikata-san...

00:17:40.998 --> 00:17:44.502
but please tell me how you truly feel.

00:17:45.336 --> 00:17:47.171
Say, "I didn't want to become a fury."

00:17:49.715 --> 00:17:51.342
There truly is no besting you...

00:17:51.676 --> 00:17:54.011
You're just like my sister in that respect.

00:17:58.224 --> 00:18:01.644
The way you spoke was somewhat
reminiscent of how she talks.

00:18:02.311 --> 00:18:07.066
It makes me feel like a family member is
scolding me and I have to do as I'm told.

00:18:09.277 --> 00:18:14.156
If that story from before is true,
my life won't shorten if I don't use those powers.

00:18:14.991 --> 00:18:16.575
So don't you worry.

00:18:17.702 --> 00:18:18.703
Right...

00:18:19.161 --> 00:18:24.834
April 28, 1868
Chimosa, Nagareyama

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:30.798
| brought you some tea.

00:18:31.632 --> 00:18:33.718
Sorry I'm always putting you out!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.970
Not at all.

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:37.847
What are you reading?

00:18:38.973 --> 00:18:39.432
The Romance of
the Three Kingdoms

00:18:39.432 --> 00:18:40.391
The Romance of the Three Kingdoms "The Romance of
the Three Kingdoms" and the "Biography of Kiyomasa."

00:18:40.391 --> 00:18:41.851
"The Romance of the Three Kingdoms"
and the "Biography of Kiyomasa."

00:18:42.101 --> 00:18:43.102
Well, I guess I only have war chronicles.

00:18:43.102 --> 00:18:44.645
Water Margin
Well, I guess I only have war chronicles.

00:18:44.645 --> 00:18:44.937
Water Margin

00:18:45.896 --> 00:18:48.232
I've read them so many times
I've practically memorized them.

00:18:49.108 --> 00:18:53.362
"Someday I'll become a wonderful general like Guan Yu,
and fight for someone other than myself,"

00:18:53.362 --> 00:18:56.115
is what I'd think to myself back when I was a kid.

00:18:57.992 --> 00:19:01.454
But dreams alone can't make you a general.

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:05.750
| just took a bit longer than most to realize that.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.501
Ah, right.

00:19:10.212 --> 00:19:11.672
Kondou-san, are you up there?

00:19:13.466 --> 00:19:14.884
What's the matter, Toshi?

00:19:15.176 --> 00:19:17.178
Prepare to escape immediately!

00:19:17.178 --> 00:19:18.387
We've been surrounded.

00:19:20.556 --> 00:19:22.683
There are 200 or 300 of them.

00:19:23.392 --> 00:19:24.393
Damn...

00:19:25.102 --> 00:19:26.312
Shimada, Chizuru...

00:19:26.687 --> 00:19:28.439
I'll handle things here.

00:19:28.439 --> 00:19:31.067
Take Kondou-san and escape out the back.

00:19:31.317 --> 00:19:32.443
No!

00:19:32.443 --> 00:19:34.445
That's crazy, even for you!

00:19:36.364 --> 00:19:39.033
Toshi, there's no need for you to go.

00:19:39.867 --> 00:19:41.702
| will go to the enemy's main unit.

00:19:43.496 --> 00:19:45.039
What's gotten into you, Kondou-san?!

00:19:45.623 --> 00:19:46.874
Don't worry.

00:19:47.541 --> 00:19:50.711
Naturally, I won't introduce myself
as Kondou of the Shinsengumi.

00:19:51.504 --> 00:19:54.548
If I say that I'm a hatamoto patrolling this area...

00:19:55.299 --> 00:19:57.176
Don't be ridiculous!

00:19:57.176 --> 00:19:59.804
You know they'll see right through that!

00:20:00.763 --> 00:20:04.225
As long as they don't pierce my heart,
| ain't going down!

00:20:04.975 --> 00:20:07.603
If we're sending someone to buy time,
I'm the better choice!

00:20:07.853 --> 00:20:10.981
No! I will be the one to draw the enemies' attention.

00:20:11.774 --> 00:20:13.984
I've already made up my mind, Toshi.

00:20:14.944 --> 00:20:16.153
Don't give me this bullshit!

00:20:16.737 --> 00:20:19.073
What will happen if we lose our commander?!

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:23.494
Your body no longer belongs to just Isami Kondou!

00:20:26.288 --> 00:20:27.706
Then this is an order!

00:20:29.875 --> 00:20:31.085
Vice Commander Hijikata...

00:20:31.752 --> 00:20:35.297
take the troops stationed here and head to Aizu!

00:20:36.924 --> 00:20:37.925
You...

00:20:38.717 --> 00:20:39.718
you're...

00:20:40.761 --> 00:20:42.179
ordering me?

00:20:43.389 --> 00:20:44.807
Why are you doing...

00:20:48.477 --> 00:20:50.896
...something so unlike you?

00:20:53.315 --> 00:20:54.525
Come on, Toshi.

00:20:55.568 --> 00:20:58.028
It's about time you let me be at peace.

00:20:59.613 --> 00:21:01.449
In order to spread my renown,

00:21:02.491 --> 00:21:06.120
you've glared angrily and run all about,

00:21:06.829 --> 00:21:08.289
and even become a fury.

00:21:09.623 --> 00:21:12.751
It's hard to see you like this.

00:21:15.504 --> 00:21:16.505
I---

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:19.467
What I've done has...

00:21:20.509 --> 00:21:22.511
torn at your heart?

00:21:25.431 --> 00:21:29.518
| thought that we would be happy together, so I...

00:21:30.519 --> 00:21:31.729
I'm sorry.

00:21:32.396 --> 00:21:35.524
| am the one who's driven you to such lengths, am I not?

00:21:40.821 --> 00:21:42.490
You ordered that as our commander, right?

00:21:44.033 --> 00:21:45.034
That's right.

00:21:47.828 --> 00:21:48.829
Understood.

00:21:49.788 --> 00:21:52.875
Shimada, have the men still here
advance to the rear exit.

00:21:53.209 --> 00:21:54.043
Sir!

00:21:54.376 --> 00:21:57.254
Chizuru, you wait here.

00:21:57.254 --> 00:21:59.215
I'll call for you when we're done with preparations.

00:21:59.215 --> 00:22:00.216
All right.

00:22:07.139 --> 00:22:08.390
Yukimura-kun...

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:09.391
Yes?

00:22:09.725 --> 00:22:12.019
| was never able to do anything for you, but...

00:22:13.729 --> 00:22:14.939
What is this?

00:22:14.939 --> 00:22:16.148
Money for your escape.

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:19.902
When you leave,
part with the Shinsengumi and run far away.

00:22:23.906 --> 00:22:26.867
| will go with Hijikata-san.

00:22:28.118 --> 00:22:29.328
Yukimura-kun...

00:22:30.037 --> 00:22:32.331
Come with us, Kondou-san.

00:22:32.748 --> 00:22:35.376
That's what Hijikata-san wants, too!

00:22:36.043 --> 00:22:37.336
| can't.

00:22:37.878 --> 00:22:39.880
If I said I wanted to flee,

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:43.509
Toshi would risk his life to fight several hundred soldiers.

00:22:45.511 --> 00:22:50.349
If Toshi uses his fury powers,
won't it eat away at his life?

00:22:51.058 --> 00:22:52.268
You knew?

00:22:53.686 --> 00:22:58.023
| cannot survive at the cost of his life.

00:23:03.862 --> 00:23:07.366
Yukimura-kun, please take care of Toshi!

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:18.961
Right...

00:23:27.553 --> 00:23:29.179
Are you truly sure about this?

00:23:29.888 --> 00:23:32.683
Yes, please take care of everyone.

00:23:34.268 --> 00:23:36.687
You're one cruel man...

00:23:38.022 --> 00:23:41.567
In the end, you're making me carry
this heavy burden on my own.

00:23:43.193 --> 00:23:44.194
Sorry.

00:23:48.240 --> 00:23:49.783
There's no besting you.

00:23:51.160 --> 00:23:52.453
How does it look?

00:23:52.453 --> 00:23:53.662
The coast is clear.

00:23:54.163 --> 00:23:55.914
All right, you go ahead.

00:23:55.914 --> 00:23:57.333
I'll follow right behind you.

00:23:58.542 --> 00:23:59.543
Let's go!

00:24:15.017 --> 00:24:16.310
Follow me!

00:24:16.310 --> 00:24:17.311
Right!

00:24:27.821 --> 00:24:29.490
Hey, you there, stop!

00:24:30.741 --> 00:24:32.618
What are you doing out here?!

00:24:34.161 --> 00:24:35.162
Move!

00:24:41.085 --> 00:24:42.503
Tough luck!

00:24:42.753 --> 00:24:45.255
You caught me right when I'm pissed!

00:24:46.131 --> 00:24:47.132
Bastards!

00:24:48.217 --> 00:24:49.426
Who are you?!

00:24:51.053 --> 00:24:53.097
Shimada, I'll handle things here.

00:24:53.597 --> 00:24:55.891
Take the troops and break through the enemy lines.

00:24:56.141 --> 00:24:57.142
Very well.

00:24:57.393 --> 00:24:58.602
Everyone, follow me!

00:25:00.479 --> 00:25:01.480
Halt!

00:25:01.480 --> 00:25:02.898
We'll fire if you don't stop!

00:25:03.107 --> 00:25:05.859
Stop!

00:25:05.859 --> 00:25:07.695
Don't do it, Hijikata-san!

00:25:07.695 --> 00:25:09.113
Don't use that power!

00:25:37.766 --> 00:25:38.976
Hijikata-san!

00:25:41.478 --> 00:25:44.189
Did Shimada and the others get away?

00:25:46.108 --> 00:25:47.735
Yes, I think so.

00:25:48.569 --> 00:25:49.778
| see...

00:25:50.821 --> 00:25:52.698
You should go while you still can.

00:25:56.577 --> 00:25:58.162
What are you doing?

00:25:58.162 --> 00:25:59.371
Go already!

00:26:01.999 --> 00:26:03.208
I'm sorry...

00:26:04.001 --> 00:26:05.627
| cannot obey that order.

00:26:09.006 --> 00:26:10.841
I'll keep out of your way,

00:26:11.842 --> 00:26:15.554
so please let me stay with you.

00:26:17.931 --> 00:26:19.391
Why have I...

00:26:20.309 --> 00:26:22.186
fought to come so far?

00:26:23.645 --> 00:26:27.399
After leaving Kondou-san behind...

00:26:28.484 --> 00:26:30.778
why did I survive?

00:26:33.697 --> 00:26:37.201
| abandoned the one person I should never abandon...

00:26:38.076 --> 00:26:39.912
I'm the only one of us to survive!

00:26:42.247 --> 00:26:46.001
Hijikata-san, just as you care for Kondou-san...

00:26:47.669 --> 00:26:50.672
Kondou-san didn't want to let you die.

00:26:52.466 --> 00:26:54.051
That's why...

00:26:54.051 --> 00:26:58.305
| think it had to turn out the way it did...

00:27:07.231 --> 00:27:13.612
April 30, 18638

00:27:15.572 --> 00:27:16.782
How was it?

00:27:22.371 --> 00:27:24.665
Edo Castle's day of surrender is set:

00:27:25.332 --> 00:27:26.708
the day after tomorrow.

00:27:26.708 --> 00:27:28.210
It's apparently May 2nd.

00:27:29.211 --> 00:27:31.505
To surrender without a fight...

00:27:32.297 --> 00:27:34.299
This is Osaka all over again.

00:27:35.259 --> 00:27:37.344
But it's not like we've lost just yet.

00:27:39.012 --> 00:27:40.472
Then we're heading to Aizu?

00:27:40.472 --> 00:27:41.348
Yes...

00:27:41.348 --> 00:27:42.349
Oops!

00:27:43.016 --> 00:27:44.893
Sorry, but it seems I forgot something.

00:27:46.186 --> 00:27:47.604
Shall I go and get it?

00:27:48.188 --> 00:27:50.858
No, I need to do it.

00:27:52.025 --> 00:27:55.112
Just wait at the tea house up ahead
and eat dango or something.

00:27:55.946 --> 00:27:56.947
Understood.

00:27:58.240 --> 00:27:59.241
Chizuru...

00:28:00.158 --> 00:28:01.285
Yes?

00:28:01.285 --> 00:28:02.911
No, it's nothing.

00:28:03.370 --> 00:28:04.580
I'll be back.

00:28:04.913 --> 00:28:05.914
Right...

00:28:16.800 --> 00:28:19.928
Did something happen to Hijikata-san?

00:28:19.928 --> 00:28:21.430
Um, Ma'am...

00:28:22.306 --> 00:28:25.142
I'm sorry, but it's closing time.

00:28:25.142 --> 00:28:27.269
Ah, right, I'm sorry.

00:28:34.276 --> 00:28:36.653
Are you Chizuru Yukimura-san?

00:28:38.071 --> 00:28:39.072
Yes...

00:28:39.448 --> 00:28:39.823
Chizuru
Yukimura-dono

00:28:39.823 --> 00:28:42.993
Chizuru Yukimura-dono Here,
Hijikata-san asked me to give you this.

00:28:42.993 --> 00:28:43.952
Chizuru
Yukimura-dono

00:28:45.203 --> 00:28:47.289
| gave it straight to you.

00:28:47.289 --> 00:28:48.498
Good enough, right?

00:28:50.208 --> 00:28:52.085
U-um, wait!

00:28:57.257 --> 00:28:59.509
Chizuru Yukimura-dono,

00:28:59.509 --> 00:29:04.264
please forgive me for informing you
of my departure in this manner.

00:29:05.223 --> 00:29:11.188
The battles ahead may prove
far too severe to bring you along.

00:29:11.772 --> 00:29:14.316
| beg you, please hurry and leave Edo,

00:29:14.316 --> 00:29:18.987
and live a peaceful, quiet life.

00:29:19.529 --> 00:29:20.739
This letter...

00:29:39.424 --> 00:29:40.634
No...

00:29:41.426 --> 00:29:42.636
Hijikata-san...

00:29:43.804 --> 00:29:47.766
May 17, 1868

00:30:00.570 --> 00:30:03.573
It seems Isami Kondou of the Shinsengumi
is going to be beheaded.

00:30:04.741 --> 00:30:05.742
By Shinsengumi,

00:30:05.742 --> 00:30:08.370
you mean that group that
slaughtered people in Kyoto?

00:30:08.370 --> 00:30:09.371
Yeah!

00:30:09.705 --> 00:30:11.123
Kondou-san will be...

00:30:11.707 --> 00:30:12.916
beheaded?!

00:30:24.344 --> 00:30:25.554
Okita-san!

00:30:29.599 --> 00:30:30.892
Chizuru-chan?

00:30:30.892 --> 00:30:32.310
What are you doing?!

00:30:32.728 --> 00:30:35.022
It should be obvious.

00:30:35.605 --> 00:30:37.441
I'm going to rescue Kondou-san.

00:30:37.441 --> 00:30:39.151
If you do that, then...

00:30:39.151 --> 00:30:40.360
Don't get in my way!

00:30:46.283 --> 00:30:49.077
Okita-san, if you push yourself with your body like this...

00:30:50.412 --> 00:30:53.081
If I don't push myself now,
then just what are you telling me to do?

00:30:54.249 --> 00:30:56.960
Kondou-san is going to be killed.

00:30:57.669 --> 00:30:58.837
Dammit!

00:30:58.837 --> 00:31:02.049
Why won't my body listen to me?!

00:31:02.674 --> 00:31:04.676
You'll just be apprehended too!

00:31:05.635 --> 00:31:07.721
| don't give a damn what happens to me.

00:31:08.346 --> 00:31:11.224
If I don't save Kondou-san, then I'll...

00:31:20.108 --> 00:31:21.359
No...

00:31:21.359 --> 00:31:23.195
You're kidding me, right?

00:31:31.870 --> 00:31:33.288
Hey, Chizuru-chan?

00:31:34.039 --> 00:31:36.458
What could Hijikata-san be doing?

00:31:37.417 --> 00:31:39.836
He didn't even come to save Kondou-san.

00:31:40.212 --> 00:31:43.632
| believe Hijikata-san is headed for Aizu.

00:31:45.550 --> 00:31:47.844
So he abandoned Kondou-san,

00:31:47.844 --> 00:31:49.971
and fled to Aizu on his own.

00:31:50.597 --> 00:31:51.765
That's not true.

00:31:51.765 --> 00:31:55.352
Kondou-san entrusted him with the Shinsengumi.

00:31:55.852 --> 00:31:57.687
| can't accept this.

00:31:58.939 --> 00:32:03.068
| need to hear the truth from Hijikata-san's own mouth.

00:32:03.568 --> 00:32:05.862
Okita-san, where are you going?!

00:32:07.572 --> 00:32:09.407
To where Hijikata-san is.

00:32:09.741 --> 00:32:11.409
You can't in that state!

00:32:11.785 --> 00:32:14.037
Besides, there's a checkpoint to leave Edo.

00:32:14.788 --> 00:32:16.915
It doesn't matter whether I can or can't.

00:32:17.707 --> 00:32:20.335
| must meet with Hijikata-san.

00:32:21.294 --> 00:32:23.004
The next time you try to stop me...

00:32:24.172 --> 00:32:25.382
I'll cut you down.

00:32:37.102 --> 00:32:38.311
Okita-san...

00:32:39.855 --> 00:32:42.065
Huh? You're the one from before...

00:32:47.070 --> 00:32:48.280
You are...

00:32:50.198 --> 00:32:51.825
Kosuzu, I'm back.

00:32:51.825 --> 00:32:53.034
Welcome home.

00:32:53.577 --> 00:32:54.786
Please go inside.

00:32:55.162 --> 00:32:56.496
Ch-Chizuru?

00:32:56.997 --> 00:32:58.248
Harada-san?!

00:32:58.248 --> 00:33:00.083
So you do know each other.

00:33:00.709 --> 00:33:02.043
Y-yeah...

00:33:02.043 --> 00:33:03.044
Welcome.

00:33:03.461 --> 00:33:04.921
It's a little cramped, but...

00:33:05.463 --> 00:33:07.132
please make yourself at home.

00:33:07.465 --> 00:33:09.426
Th-thank you.

00:33:12.929 --> 00:33:16.766
| see, so Souji's heading over there,
even though he's in bad shape.

00:33:19.352 --> 00:33:22.355
So, Hijikata-san left you behind?

00:33:22.939 --> 00:33:23.940
Yes...

00:33:27.444 --> 00:33:30.197
| think his feelings are justified.

00:33:30.530 --> 00:33:34.784
You're better off separating from the Shinsengumi
and going back to being a normal woman.

00:33:35.202 --> 00:33:37.746
That's what they call "a woman's happiness."

00:33:38.288 --> 00:33:39.623
But I...

00:33:40.248 --> 00:33:44.044
Hijikata-san wants you to be happy.

00:33:48.215 --> 00:33:51.885
Wouldn't it be nice to live more the way you want?

00:33:52.469 --> 00:33:54.304
The way I want?

00:33:54.679 --> 00:33:55.680
Yeah...

00:33:56.264 --> 00:33:57.474
Then I...

00:33:57.891 --> 00:33:59.976
want to be with Hijikata-san.

00:33:59.976 --> 00:34:01.603
| want to be by his side!

00:34:08.735 --> 00:34:10.570
Then why not go?

00:34:12.030 --> 00:34:13.240
Ryunosuke-san!

00:34:14.115 --> 00:34:15.325
What?

00:34:19.246 --> 00:34:25.085
I'm sure both Harada and Hijikata-san
think about you when they say all these things,

00:34:25.085 --> 00:34:28.755
but the way you live your life
isn't for others to decide, right?

00:34:29.172 --> 00:34:30.882
Hey, hold on now...

00:34:31.841 --> 00:34:35.178
| said that she could live the way she wants, didn't 1?

00:34:39.933 --> 00:34:41.142
Hey, Chizuru?

00:34:41.643 --> 00:34:44.813
You're worried about Hijikata-san, yeah?

00:34:46.064 --> 00:34:48.066
Even though you know it will be rough...

00:34:48.566 --> 00:34:50.568
do you still want to be by his side?

00:34:51.319 --> 00:34:52.320
Yes!

00:34:52.320 --> 00:34:54.364
Then there's nothing to hesitate about, right?

00:34:56.157 --> 00:34:59.411
A person's happiness depends on their way of thinking.

00:35:00.161 --> 00:35:02.539
"We want to live without regrets"...

00:35:02.539 --> 00:35:04.958
That's what we were always saying, yeah?

00:35:05.583 --> 00:35:06.793
Harada-san...

00:35:09.254 --> 00:35:13.258
If you meant what you said,
| would have liked to take you all the way to Aizu,

00:35:13.258 --> 00:35:16.428
but I still have things I need to do here in Edo.

00:35:16.845 --> 00:35:19.514
| have some business with these guys
called the Shogitai Company.

00:35:19.973 --> 00:35:21.808
It looks like you'll be on your own, so...

00:35:22.517 --> 00:35:23.727
will you still go?

00:35:27.063 --> 00:35:28.064
Yes!

00:35:32.360 --> 00:35:34.946
Later Ryunosuke, Kosuzu.

00:35:35.322 --> 00:35:37.574
Yeah, come back any time you want.

00:35:37.991 --> 00:35:39.701
Take care of yourself, Chizuru-san.

00:35:40.160 --> 00:35:42.662
Thank you both so much!

00:35:45.373 --> 00:35:46.416
Well then...

00:35:46.416 --> 00:35:47.625
See you!

00:35:51.546 --> 00:35:54.632
The Imperial Army have control
of the Senju checkpoint.

00:35:54.632 --> 00:35:56.968
Even if you have identification papers,
you won't get through there.

00:35:57.385 --> 00:36:00.513
Cut through the forest in the back
and then head north.

00:36:01.097 --> 00:36:02.307
Got it.

00:36:02.724 --> 00:36:05.810
Because later, I'll definitely head to Aizu, too.

00:36:06.227 --> 00:36:08.897
Then I'll head over there first and wait for you, okay?

00:36:09.397 --> 00:36:11.232
Yeah, it's a promise.

00:36:14.152 --> 00:36:15.779
Take care of yourself!

00:36:16.071 --> 00:36:17.072
Right!

00:36:17.322 --> 00:36:18.948
You too, Harada-san.

00:36:27.791 --> 00:36:29.000
Now then...

00:36:29.709 --> 00:36:31.378
Guess it's time to stir things up!

00:36:38.551 --> 00:36:41.763
The captain of the Shinsengumi's 10th unit,

00:36:41.763 --> 00:36:44.057
Sanosuke Harada, has arrived!

00:36:44.349 --> 00:36:47.268
I'll take on any of you who are confident in their skills!

00:36:47.811 --> 00:36:49.104
The Shinsengumi?!

00:36:49.104 --> 00:36:50.522
Cut him down! Kill him!

00:37:12.877 --> 00:37:15.296
All of you, stay where you are!

00:37:17.715 --> 00:37:18.925
Who's there?!

00:37:20.760 --> 00:37:21.928
What is it?

00:37:21.928 --> 00:37:23.138
Do you see anything?

00:37:23.847 --> 00:37:24.848
Where?

00:37:25.807 --> 00:37:28.726
Isn't that enough, Harada?

00:37:31.604 --> 00:37:32.814
Shiranui?

00:38:00.008 --> 00:38:01.426
Are you awake now?

00:38:09.267 --> 00:38:12.270
Even though you're a devil,
you're better off not moving just yet.

00:38:13.980 --> 00:38:15.607
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:38:16.149 --> 00:38:19.152
Even the imperial soldiers wouldn't come here.

00:38:19.986 --> 00:38:21.821
What do you intend to do with me?

00:38:22.280 --> 00:38:25.575
The soldiers were roused by the commotion
you caused breaking through the checkpoint,

00:38:25.909 --> 00:38:29.162
but I have no intention of handing
one of my own over to humans.

00:38:33.208 --> 00:38:36.920
You're not even going to thank
the person who saved you?

00:38:40.298 --> 00:38:42.509
Thank you...

00:38:45.762 --> 00:38:46.971
Harada-san...

00:38:47.138 --> 00:38:48.348
Relax.

00:38:49.098 --> 00:38:52.393
It seems he's as quick at running away as always.

00:38:55.688 --> 00:38:56.689
Thank goodness.

00:39:05.365 --> 00:39:09.953
You said you rescued me because I am
one of your own, because I'm a devil, right?

00:39:11.037 --> 00:39:14.123
But I don't know anything about devils.

00:39:19.420 --> 00:39:24.008
We devils have lived in this
land since time immemorial.

00:39:24.592 --> 00:39:28.054
However, because we possessed a power
that made us far superior to the humans,

00:39:28.429 --> 00:39:33.601
they feared us and tried to win us over to use us.

00:39:34.519 --> 00:39:35.728
For that reason...

00:39:36.104 --> 00:39:40.942
the ancient devils chose to hide and
no longer appear before the humans.

00:39:42.735 --> 00:39:48.575
Then, why did all of you ally yourselves
with Satsuma and Choshu?

00:39:49.075 --> 00:39:51.578
To repay the debts of our ancestors.

00:39:52.120 --> 00:39:54.122
However, times have changed.

00:39:54.747 --> 00:39:57.292
| no longer intend to lend them any aid.

00:39:58.751 --> 00:40:04.340
The Yukimura clan was the oldest
and largest in the east,

00:40:04.340 --> 00:40:06.175
but I had heard they were wiped out.

00:40:06.384 --> 00:40:09.012
You and Kodo are the survivors.

00:40:09.887 --> 00:40:14.934
So my father is using furies to try
and restore the Yukimura clan?

00:40:15.518 --> 00:40:21.316
To produce such fakes, and use them
to become involved in the world of man...

00:40:21.316 --> 00:40:24.485
His actions are an insult to a devil's pride.

00:40:26.863 --> 00:40:29.949
Where did you intend to go
after slipping past the checkpoint?

00:40:32.660 --> 00:40:35.913
Did you plan to follow the Shinsengumi?

00:40:38.583 --> 00:40:40.668
In that case you should give up.

00:40:40.668 --> 00:40:43.254
After all, they're humans.

00:40:44.130 --> 00:40:49.886
Under the "just cause" of war, they're simply
scrambling for authority and money.

00:40:50.470 --> 00:40:52.305
That's not true!

00:40:52.305 --> 00:40:56.100
There are also those who risk their lives,
fighting for the sake of others!

00:40:58.061 --> 00:40:59.896
You're a strange one.

00:41:01.147 --> 00:41:05.902
What do you think you can accomplish
by wandering onto the battlefield?

00:41:07.445 --> 00:41:09.656
| may not be able to do anything.

00:41:10.406 --> 00:41:11.407
But...

00:41:11.699 --> 00:41:14.452
| want to help them!

00:41:14.827 --> 00:41:17.413
Even if you must fight against Kodo?

00:41:18.623 --> 00:41:21.084
I'll stop him when the time comes.

00:41:21.709 --> 00:41:23.544
You'll stop Kodo?

00:41:25.421 --> 00:41:26.673
Amusing.

00:41:27.131 --> 00:41:29.342
Regardless, I have business in Aizu.

00:41:29.717 --> 00:41:32.345
If you intend to go, then you can join me.

00:42:09.757 --> 00:42:10.758
That's...

00:42:11.759 --> 00:42:13.594
...Shirakawa Castle.

00:42:14.303 --> 00:42:17.765
But it seems it's already fallen into the
hands of the Imperial Army.

00:42:27.066 --> 00:42:28.067
Um...

00:42:28.693 --> 00:42:29.902
Where are we?

00:42:43.458 --> 00:42:45.668
It used to be so much more beautiful...

00:42:58.014 --> 00:43:00.308
Kazama-san, um...

00:43:01.017 --> 00:43:03.060
The ruins of the main Yukimura estate...

00:43:03.728 --> 00:43:06.314
This is where you lived as a child.

00:43:08.399 --> 00:43:09.817
Where I lived?

00:43:10.651 --> 00:43:13.362
Satsuma, Choshu, Tosa...

00:43:13.905 --> 00:43:16.073
The domains of the west

00:43:16.073 --> 00:43:20.912
were trying to borrow the power of
us western devils in order to defeat the Bakufu.

00:43:21.579 --> 00:43:23.831
Knowing this, the Bakufu

00:43:23.831 --> 00:43:29.545
tried to propose an alliance with one of
the eastern devil families, the Yukimura clan.

00:43:29.879 --> 00:43:31.088
The Bakufu did?

00:43:31.964 --> 00:43:33.174
However,

00:43:33.174 --> 00:43:38.554
your clan did not consider it acceptable to involve
themselves in a struggle between humans,

00:43:38.554 --> 00:43:40.723
and so they refused that invitation.

00:43:41.349 --> 00:43:46.604
So because they wouldn't become allies,
they were all wiped out?

00:43:47.563 --> 00:43:50.983
Do you hate the humans that killed your true parents?

00:43:59.408 --> 00:44:02.286
"To not be involved in a struggle between humans"...

00:44:02.745 --> 00:44:05.832
that is how a true devil should be.

00:44:06.707 --> 00:44:11.420
In that way, your clan carried out their pride as devils.

00:44:12.839 --> 00:44:16.050
Is the reason my father wishes to
restore the Yukimura clan

00:44:16.342 --> 00:44:18.719
for the sake of revenge?

00:44:21.430 --> 00:44:23.850
If that is so, then what will you do?

00:44:26.519 --> 00:44:31.148
To involve innocent people for the sake of revenge...

00:44:31.816 --> 00:44:33.025
is wrong.

00:44:34.610 --> 00:44:36.863
I'm at a loss, Chizuru.

00:44:37.822 --> 00:44:39.657
With that opinion of yours...

00:44:50.710 --> 00:44:53.421
Kaoru Nagumo...

00:44:54.797 --> 00:44:58.009
| thank you for bringing Chizuru this far.

00:44:59.427 --> 00:45:02.054
However, your role is over.

00:45:02.388 --> 00:45:04.390
Would you please go away now?

00:45:04.974 --> 00:45:09.979
| have determined that this girl is the
last head of the Yukimura clan.

00:45:10.855 --> 00:45:14.734
As the head of the Kazama clan,
which controls the west,

00:45:14.734 --> 00:45:16.819
| am talking to her.

00:45:18.154 --> 00:45:20.197
| won't forgive anyone who gets in the way.

00:45:20.197 --> 00:45:21.407
In the way?

00:45:22.533 --> 00:45:25.870
Who's the one getting in the way of
a fateful reunion between siblings?

00:45:26.621 --> 00:45:27.622
Siblings?!

00:45:28.080 --> 00:45:29.290
That's right.

00:45:29.624 --> 00:45:32.460
You're my little sister, related by blood.

00:45:34.170 --> 00:45:36.589
It's nothing to be so surprised about.

00:45:37.131 --> 00:45:38.966
Our faces look so much alike.

00:45:40.343 --> 00:45:45.181
And my katana and your kodachi are a pair.

00:45:47.850 --> 00:45:49.310
| don't have a big brother...

00:45:50.102 --> 00:45:51.520
or any siblings!

00:45:52.355 --> 00:45:54.899
That makes me sad, Chizuru.

00:45:56.359 --> 00:45:59.904
When we were little, we were always together,
no matter where we went.

00:46:01.530 --> 00:46:07.078
If you're my big brother,
then why didn't Father ever tell me?

00:46:07.662 --> 00:46:11.832
Perhaps I'm a trigger,
so he didn't want you to remember

00:46:11.832 --> 00:46:13.876
the time when the village was destroyed.

00:46:23.594 --> 00:46:27.014
But you don't need to be sad anymore.

00:46:27.682 --> 00:46:29.892
Because from here on out, we'll be together.

00:46:35.189 --> 00:46:39.485
It seems the head of the western devils
is being uncooperative.

00:46:40.277 --> 00:46:42.113
| told you to go away, didn't 1?

00:46:42.780 --> 00:46:45.241
If you're trying to interfere with us,

00:46:45.241 --> 00:46:47.368
then I won't forgive you, no matter who you may be.

00:46:48.285 --> 00:46:53.082
My goal is to destroy all of the furies...

00:46:53.833 --> 00:46:58.045
and the one who creates those furies as well.

00:46:58.045 --> 00:46:59.255
Silence!

00:47:02.341 --> 00:47:03.551
It's no use.

00:47:08.973 --> 00:47:11.183
You drank the Water of Life?!

00:47:12.309 --> 00:47:13.644
That's right!

00:47:13.644 --> 00:47:15.938
I've surpassed you!

00:47:16.897 --> 00:47:18.399
You scum!

00:47:31.746 --> 00:47:32.788
Move!

00:47:32.788 --> 00:47:34.123
| refuse!

00:47:34.123 --> 00:47:35.791
| won't let you have Chizuru!

00:47:35.791 --> 00:47:37.418
You're in my way!

00:47:42.923 --> 00:47:44.258
There's...

00:47:44.258 --> 00:47:47.094
there's no way that you understand...

00:47:47.928 --> 00:47:49.764
the Yukimura clan's humiliation!

00:47:55.978 --> 00:47:57.605
We're both devils.

00:47:57.605 --> 00:47:59.607
I should certainly understand.

00:48:00.357 --> 00:48:01.358
However...

00:48:02.318 --> 00:48:06.322
you people have crossed a line
which should never be crossed.

00:48:07.615 --> 00:48:11.410
Detoler S, 1362
Nihonmatsy

00:48:21.712 --> 00:48:22.713
Chizuru?

00:48:31.889 --> 00:48:36.435
So devils and furies appear similar
but are quite different in nature?

00:48:37.103 --> 00:48:40.439
Yes, the furies were imported from the West,

00:48:40.439 --> 00:48:43.859
and they inherited the blood of devils
who are a different breed from us.

00:48:44.318 --> 00:48:50.241
The Water of Life is that blood,
modified so that humans can accept it.

00:48:51.033 --> 00:48:56.539
Therefore, furies inherited
the nature of those Western devils.

00:48:56.956 --> 00:49:00.793
Even furies like that can become power for us.

00:49:00.793 --> 00:49:03.170
Hmm, what an unusual visitor.

00:49:03.546 --> 00:49:04.964
Kaoru-kun?

00:49:05.256 --> 00:49:06.465
How did it go?

00:49:06.757 --> 00:49:08.843
| got a hold of Chizuru, as planned.

00:49:09.301 --> 00:49:11.679
| see, good work.

00:49:11.846 --> 00:49:13.973
If traitors are showing up,

00:49:13.973 --> 00:49:16.475
then this must mean the Shinsengumi
are already done for.

00:49:17.977 --> 00:49:20.813
Not at all, he's simply prudent.

00:49:21.272 --> 00:49:26.068
He's able to properly understand that
joining with us is a good plan.

00:49:27.528 --> 00:49:31.240
Did the information about Bonari Pass being
short-handed come from him?

00:49:31.240 --> 00:49:32.074
Yes.

00:49:41.000 --> 00:49:42.209
Where am I?

00:50:00.936 --> 00:50:02.146
Chizuru...

00:50:02.897 --> 00:50:04.523
Are you here, Chizuru?

00:50:04.940 --> 00:50:06.358
Is that you, Heisuke-kun?

00:50:06.650 --> 00:50:08.861
Thank goodness you're all right.

00:50:09.028 --> 00:50:10.237
Heisuke-kun!

00:50:10.738 --> 00:50:12.531
| realize you just got back,

00:50:12.531 --> 00:50:17.077
but could you take the fury unit
and proceed to Bonari Pass for me?

00:50:17.203 --> 00:50:18.245
Sure thing.

00:50:18.245 --> 00:50:22.917
I'll kill every last member of
the Shinsengumi left in Aizu for you.

00:50:29.590 --> 00:50:31.550
We're heading over to Bonari Pass!

00:50:31.550 --> 00:50:33.385
Fury unit, follow me!

00:50:38.349 --> 00:50:39.391
Bonari Pass...

00:50:39.391 --> 00:50:40.601
Heisuke-kun?

00:50:40.893 --> 00:50:42.102
Let's hurry!

00:50:43.103 --> 00:50:46.941
So you wish to increase the number of furies
and create a world of devils?

00:50:46.941 --> 00:50:48.234
Not at all...

00:50:48.234 --> 00:50:51.278
| simply wish to become part of
the new government which holds power,

00:50:51.654 --> 00:50:56.492
and for us devils to have our existence
recognized by the humans.

00:50:56.492 --> 00:50:57.993
| see...

00:50:57.993 --> 00:51:01.121
Then, why are you fixated on her now?

00:51:02.164 --> 00:51:05.209
A female devil from the main family
is an entity of significant value.

00:51:05.876 --> 00:51:09.296
Most importantly,
the blood of a pure devil such as her

00:51:09.755 --> 00:51:12.216
can be used to suppress the
bloodsucking urges of the furies,

00:51:12.216 --> 00:51:15.177
and depending on the research,
may even allow us to change you

00:51:15.427 --> 00:51:18.847
into true devils like us.

00:51:19.265 --> 00:51:21.475
Change us into true devils?

00:51:23.894 --> 00:51:29.566
| have not forgotten the tragic history
of the devil clans for even a day.

00:51:30.317 --> 00:51:35.406
So that devils may one day gain power
and stand equal to the humans...

00:51:35.698 --> 00:51:37.950
| deceived the Yukimura main house.

00:51:38.200 --> 00:51:41.662
I've gone as far as to ally with the humans,
I've gotten a hold of that girl,

00:51:42.079 --> 00:51:44.498
and I've been able to add to my research.

00:51:45.749 --> 00:51:48.627
You were the one who did that
to the Yukimura village, Father?!

00:51:48.627 --> 00:51:49.461
Chizuru!

00:51:50.170 --> 00:51:51.005
Wait!

00:51:51.005 --> 00:51:51.714
Chizuru!

00:51:54.591 --> 00:51:56.427
There was nothing I could do.

00:51:56.719 --> 00:52:01.348
Your clan, living in hiding in
that mountain village, lost in time,

00:52:01.849 --> 00:52:04.351
lost the ability to keep up with the flow of the times.

00:52:04.893 --> 00:52:06.103
That can't be...

00:52:06.103 --> 00:52:07.521
Such selfish reasoning...

00:52:08.063 --> 00:52:12.693
Tomorrow's battle at Bonari Pass will be
a complete victory for us.

00:52:13.360 --> 00:52:17.239
The humans will have no choice
but to acknowledge our power.

00:52:17.906 --> 00:52:21.535
Sannan-san, what are you doing here?!

00:52:22.202 --> 00:52:24.830
It seems you've become a fury as well, Toudou-kun.

00:52:25.456 --> 00:52:26.790
So how about it?

00:52:26.790 --> 00:52:30.961
Do you want to try living in a new era with us?

00:52:31.670 --> 00:52:33.505
So that's what's going on?!

00:52:35.549 --> 00:52:40.137
Yes, that will be good for us, right?

00:52:40.596 --> 00:52:41.847
That can't be!

00:52:45.434 --> 00:52:46.435
Chizuru...

00:52:50.272 --> 00:52:53.233
I've known Toudou-kun for a long time.

00:52:53.233 --> 00:52:56.528
At the very least, I would like to
finish him by my own hand.

00:52:56.945 --> 00:52:58.155
Would that be all right?

00:52:58.447 --> 00:52:59.865
People like you are...

00:53:00.657 --> 00:53:01.867
| don't mind.

00:53:01.867 --> 00:53:04.828
As long as Chizuru lives, then that's fine.

00:53:05.162 --> 00:53:06.914
Father, stop!

00:53:07.122 --> 00:53:10.167
We were a fruitless creation of the times.

00:53:10.167 --> 00:53:12.586
We never should have come to be to begin with.

00:53:13.379 --> 00:53:15.005
Chizuru, get back!

00:53:21.804 --> 00:53:23.305
Sannan-san, I knew it!

00:53:24.848 --> 00:53:26.683
Honestly, you two—

00:53:32.689 --> 00:53:35.192
How unfortunate, Sannan-kun.

00:53:35.192 --> 00:53:37.277
Sannan-san!

00:53:37.277 --> 00:53:38.445
Dammit!

00:53:43.450 --> 00:53:44.660
Please, hang on!

00:53:47.371 --> 00:53:49.665
It seems it's a silver bullet.

00:53:50.124 --> 00:53:52.126
| made an oversight...

00:53:52.543 --> 00:53:54.461
Hurry, run away...

00:53:55.254 --> 00:53:57.089
Sannan-san! Sannan-san!

00:53:58.132 --> 00:53:59.341
Sannan-san!

00:54:07.641 --> 00:54:08.642
Chizuru!

00:54:11.728 --> 00:54:12.938
Stay close to me.

00:54:17.109 --> 00:54:18.318
Heisuke-kun!

00:54:28.245 --> 00:54:30.247
Chikage Kazamal!

00:54:32.124 --> 00:54:33.208
Chizuru, this way!

00:54:33.208 --> 00:54:34.209
Right!

00:54:42.009 --> 00:54:43.218
Heisuke-kun!

00:54:43.510 --> 00:54:44.511
I'm fine!

00:54:44.511 --> 00:54:45.721
Stand back, Chizuru!

00:54:51.852 --> 00:54:53.061
Heisuke-kun!

00:54:57.065 --> 00:54:58.275
Kazama-san?

00:55:04.448 --> 00:55:06.867
| killed Kodo.

00:55:07.868 --> 00:55:09.077
Do you think ill of me?

00:55:12.331 --> 00:55:13.999
Thank you...

00:55:14.583 --> 00:55:16.001
for stopping my father.

00:55:17.252 --> 00:55:20.923
Just as I'd expect from the successor
of the Yukimura lineage.

00:55:22.841 --> 00:55:24.134
So you're a fake, huh?

00:55:24.134 --> 00:55:25.135
What?!

00:55:26.178 --> 00:55:28.805
You'll do in place of a guard dog.

00:55:29.598 --> 00:55:34.228
Take this girl to where your comrades are.

00:55:34.895 --> 00:55:40.150
However, next time we meet, I'll kill you without fail.

00:55:40.817 --> 00:55:42.444
Yeah, I'll take her all right...

00:55:42.861 --> 00:55:45.864
to the person who should really be protecting her.

00:55:48.200 --> 00:55:52.412
Oetole> 7, 1863

00:55:52.412 --> 00:55:55.123
Bonari Pass

00:55:55.499 --> 00:55:56.708
Were we too late?

00:55:58.544 --> 00:56:00.921
Don't tell me that Hijikata-san and the others were also...

00:56:01.213 --> 00:56:02.422
I'm sure he's fine.

00:56:02.798 --> 00:56:05.801
He isn't the type to die in a place like this.

00:56:06.468 --> 00:56:07.678
Anyway, let's hurry.

00:56:12.224 --> 00:56:13.517
| see...

00:56:13.517 --> 00:56:16.144
so Lord Katamori was evacuated from the castle safely.

00:56:16.144 --> 00:56:16.979
Yes!

00:56:16.979 --> 00:56:18.188
Hajime-kun!

00:56:18.355 --> 00:56:20.190
Heisuke? Where did you...

00:56:20.774 --> 00:56:21.775
Yukimura?

00:56:22.234 --> 00:56:25.320
Saito-san, so you're okay.

00:56:25.654 --> 00:56:26.655
Thank goodness.

00:56:27.406 --> 00:56:29.408
Why are you here?

00:56:29.658 --> 00:56:31.868
She says she followed us here from Edo.

00:56:32.661 --> 00:56:33.870
More importantly,

00:56:33.870 --> 00:56:36.832
it seems that the enemy are
seriously throwing furies into battle.

00:56:36.832 --> 00:56:41.670
Yes, a mere day after the loss at
Bonari Pass, Inawashiro fell.

00:56:43.005 --> 00:56:44.214
Is that so?

00:56:44.673 --> 00:56:46.675
Which reminds me, how is Sannan-san?

00:56:47.217 --> 00:56:50.095
At Nihonmatsu he fought against the enemy and...

00:56:51.221 --> 00:56:52.472
Is he dead?

00:56:52.472 --> 00:56:53.473
Yeah...

00:56:54.474 --> 00:56:55.684
| see...

00:56:57.227 --> 00:57:01.189
He said he had an excellent idea for
drawing the enemy to Bonari Pass, but...

00:57:05.068 --> 00:57:07.195
By the way, where is Hijikata-san?

00:57:07.529 --> 00:57:13.160
Under orders from Otori, he was sent with the rest
of the former Bakufu's military forces to Sendai.

00:57:14.411 --> 00:57:15.829
So we didn't make it in time?

00:57:16.538 --> 00:57:19.166
Um, what about Okita-san and Harada-san?

00:57:19.583 --> 00:57:22.210
Souji is heading this way?

00:57:22.210 --> 00:57:23.211
Yes...

00:57:23.754 --> 00:57:25.964
He's coming despite his condition...

00:57:26.548 --> 00:57:30.761
Shinpachi went to Yonezawa to request reinforcements,
but I haven't heard from him.

00:57:31.303 --> 00:57:34.222
Sano apparently said that he had
some business to attend to in Edo, but...

00:57:34.389 --> 00:57:37.392
Yes, I believe he said it was with the Shogitai Company.

00:57:37.934 --> 00:57:39.269
The Shogitai Company?

00:57:39.269 --> 00:57:40.270
Yes.

00:57:40.854 --> 00:57:42.230
The Shogitai...

00:57:42.481 --> 00:57:45.233
It seems they took a beating from the Satcho forces

00:57:45.233 --> 00:57:49.154
and were wiped out at the Kan'ei-ji Temple in Ueno.

00:57:49.529 --> 00:57:50.739
That can't be!

00:57:50.739 --> 00:57:53.784
But Harada-san said that he would
definitely come to Aizul!

00:57:54.743 --> 00:57:55.952
He promised!

00:57:56.662 --> 00:57:57.663
I---

00:57:58.705 --> 00:58:00.707
Yeah, it's a promise.

00:58:18.141 --> 00:58:20.769
I've mended it, so please use it.

00:58:21.478 --> 00:58:22.479
I'm sorry.

00:58:22.479 --> 00:58:23.480
It's okay.

00:58:23.480 --> 00:58:26.108
After all, this is about all I can do.

00:58:28.735 --> 00:58:31.655
Leave here now, and head to Sendai.

00:58:32.948 --> 00:58:35.158
What will you all do?

00:58:35.409 --> 00:58:41.415
It's our duty to buy time for
Commander Hijikata to rally in Sendai.

00:58:42.165 --> 00:58:43.166
But...

00:58:45.293 --> 00:58:47.295
Please tell the Commander...

00:58:47.295 --> 00:58:50.173
that we have this banner of sincerity with us.

00:58:51.842 --> 00:58:52.843
Right.

00:58:55.929 --> 00:58:58.682
Take care, you two!

00:58:59.474 --> 00:59:01.685
Can't say that we will, right?

00:59:01.977 --> 00:59:02.978
Right...

00:59:03.562 --> 00:59:06.398
but I won't waste my life.

00:59:11.236 --> 00:59:13.655
Aizu sure is a nice place.

00:59:14.698 --> 00:59:19.536
I've lived thinking that I might still have some
unfinished business, and even became a fury.

00:59:20.245 --> 00:59:22.664
But I might have lived for the sake of this war.

00:59:22.998 --> 00:59:23.999
Heisuke...

00:59:24.791 --> 00:59:26.626
Don't stop me today.

00:59:26.918 --> 00:59:29.921
After all, I'm the master of charging in.

00:59:30.839 --> 00:59:31.882
Right!

00:59:31.882 --> 00:59:35.510
I'm proud to be able to fight alongside you.

00:59:42.350 --> 00:59:44.603
Yo! They're really going at it.

00:59:44.811 --> 00:59:46.772
What did you come here for?

00:59:46.772 --> 00:59:48.607
Just to observe.

00:59:51.485 --> 00:59:52.694
The furies...

00:59:53.445 --> 00:59:54.905
What happened to the furies?

00:59:56.406 --> 01:00:00.702
| think the ones that went to
Kan'ei-ji Temple were wiped out.

01:00:01.411 --> 01:00:02.829
Is that so?

01:00:05.957 --> 01:00:09.503
Why did you help me?

01:00:10.420 --> 01:00:13.840
| don't like that fury-using government's
way of doing things.

01:00:14.382 --> 01:00:15.592
That's all.

01:00:17.093 --> 01:00:18.303
| see...

01:00:18.970 --> 01:00:21.598
What are you going to do now?

01:00:22.057 --> 01:00:24.267
| promised Chizuru...

01:00:24.893 --> 01:00:27.312
So I need to go to Aizu...

01:00:27.729 --> 01:00:29.940
Harada, this is Aizu...

01:00:30.106 --> 01:00:31.316
Fire!

01:01:17.195 --> 01:01:18.196
Heisuke?!

01:01:19.197 --> 01:01:20.198
What's wrong?

01:01:21.575 --> 01:01:23.785
It looks like I've reached my limit.

01:01:25.036 --> 01:01:28.039
My wounds just won't heal.

01:01:29.416 --> 01:01:30.417
Heisuke...

01:01:31.418 --> 01:01:37.048
Was I at least a little helpful?

01:01:38.425 --> 01:01:40.427
Yes, you saved me...

01:01:42.679 --> 01:01:43.680
Heisuke!

01:01:50.061 --> 01:01:52.814
Hajime-kun, your back's completely open.

01:01:53.356 --> 01:01:54.357
Souiji!

01:01:56.067 --> 01:01:58.862
It's not good to have trouble with these guys.

01:02:00.697 --> 01:02:03.533
By the way, is Hijikata-san here?

01:02:04.034 --> 01:02:06.828
Commander Hijikata headed for Sendai.

01:02:08.121 --> 01:02:11.958
He left everyone behind and ran away on his own.

01:02:12.959 --> 01:02:14.711
He's a complete and utter coward, huh?

01:02:14.961 --> 01:02:16.379
That's not true.

01:02:16.379 --> 01:02:18.632
Just as Commander Kondou did,

01:02:18.632 --> 01:02:21.301
we chose to entrust him
with the future of the Shinsengumi.

01:02:23.762 --> 01:02:27.265
Chizuru-chan said the same sort of thing.

01:02:27.849 --> 01:02:30.518
But without him here, there's no way to confirm that.

01:02:31.811 --> 01:02:33.229
Well, if it isn't Okita.

01:02:33.438 --> 01:02:35.065
So you're still alive.

01:02:36.358 --> 01:02:38.526
To think we'd meet even in Aizu...

01:02:38.526 --> 01:02:40.987
Has anyone ever told you that you're annoying?

01:02:40.987 --> 01:02:41.988
What?!

01:02:42.989 --> 01:02:44.199
Oh, that's right.

01:02:44.449 --> 01:02:47.452
That must be why Chizuru-chan hates you.

01:02:47.744 --> 01:02:48.745
Shut up!

01:02:49.162 --> 01:02:50.789
Shut the hell up, Okita!

01:02:50.789 --> 01:02:53.500
What could you possibly understand?!

01:03:04.344 --> 01:03:06.179
What's wrong, Okita?!

01:03:08.014 --> 01:03:10.642
Chizuru needs me!

01:03:21.569 --> 01:03:24.406
| hate losing.

01:03:25.073 --> 01:03:27.283
So I'll pay you back for what you did in the capital!

01:03:33.123 --> 01:03:34.124
Souiji!

01:03:34.124 --> 01:03:35.333
Are you all right?

01:03:35.625 --> 01:03:36.835
I'm fine...

01:03:36.835 --> 01:03:39.421
| can't be defeated by something like this.

01:03:40.922 --> 01:03:43.675
Because if I don't at least
say a few words to Hijikata-san,

01:03:43.675 --> 01:03:45.385
then I'll never feel at peace.

01:03:51.391 --> 01:03:52.392
Souiji...

01:03:52.976 --> 01:03:54.185
the reinforcements.

01:04:23.381 --> 01:04:27.385
| am the captain of the Shinsengumi's 3rd unit,
Hajime Saito!

01:04:28.053 --> 01:04:32.182
| won't let you take even one step past this point!

01:04:44.152 --> 01:04:47.155
It seems the Shinsengumi are headed for Ezo.

01:04:49.115 --> 01:04:51.117
How long do you intend to keep doing this?

01:04:52.118 --> 01:04:56.122
You're supposed to have duties to fulfill
as the head of the Kazama clan.

01:04:56.748 --> 01:04:59.751
To neglect those duties and chase after humans...

01:05:00.293 --> 01:05:04.130
These are the actions of a stray devil,
and will see you exiled from your clan.

01:05:13.598 --> 01:05:16.434
It seems your journey was fruitless as well.

01:05:17.644 --> 01:05:18.645
No...

01:05:19.187 --> 01:05:22.816
No matter what happens, I'm going to him.

01:05:23.316 --> 01:05:27.320
He may not think of you as someone he needs.

01:05:27.779 --> 01:05:28.780
Even so...

01:05:31.241 --> 01:05:33.451
| want to be by his side.

01:05:34.452 --> 01:05:39.082
When spring comes,
the new government will cross over to Ezo.

01:05:39.499 --> 01:05:43.503
At that time, if you still wish to go there...

01:05:44.546 --> 01:05:46.965
then come with me.

01:05:51.803 --> 01:05:56.641
A month ago, the new government landed
and took control of Nanaehama.

01:05:57.267 --> 01:06:00.895
It's only a matter of time until Goryokaku falls.

01:06:01.312 --> 01:06:04.315
Hijikata may even be dead already.

01:06:04.774 --> 01:06:06.609
He isn't dead.

01:06:07.402 --> 01:06:10.822
I'm sure he'll be fighting until the bitter end.

01:06:13.283 --> 01:06:16.703
This boat will reach Nanaehama shortly.

01:06:17.787 --> 01:06:19.205
After that, you can do as you wish.

01:06:22.417 --> 01:06:23.418
Hurry!

01:06:32.177 --> 01:06:34.804
Thank you for everything you've done till now.

01:06:35.597 --> 01:06:38.474
As long as Hijikata is a fury,

01:06:38.975 --> 01:06:42.187
| must kill him.

01:06:43.354 --> 01:06:45.773
Will you go, even knowing that?

01:06:52.030 --> 01:06:53.364
Don't go.

01:06:53.364 --> 01:06:56.576
You don't need to suffer any longer.

01:07:00.496 --> 01:07:01.915
Thank you...

01:07:02.874 --> 01:07:04.876
but I'm...

01:07:06.544 --> 01:07:07.754
going!

01:07:27.815 --> 01:07:28.483
Fire!

01:07:36.241 --> 01:07:39.077
If I make it past here, I should reach Goryokaku.

01:07:43.039 --> 01:07:44.540
Cineerity

01:08:07.105 --> 01:08:08.106
Chizuru?

01:08:09.732 --> 01:08:10.692
Hang on!

01:08:10.692 --> 01:08:12.235
Hey! Stay with me!

01:08:25.540 --> 01:08:26.749
Have you come to?

01:08:27.834 --> 01:08:29.252
Are you feeling all right?

01:08:30.128 --> 01:08:31.129
Yes...

01:08:32.005 --> 01:08:33.214
Why did you come here?

01:08:33.881 --> 01:08:37.302
Because I'm your attendant.

01:08:38.553 --> 01:08:39.554
You...

01:08:40.596 --> 01:08:42.432
<i>Aizu and Sendai...</i>

01:08:43.141 --> 01:08:45.435
| was always following the Shinsengumi...

01:08:45.435 --> 01:08:47.645
Following you, Hijikata-san.

01:08:48.396 --> 01:08:49.605
You're such a fool...

01:08:50.148 --> 01:08:52.984
Why do you think I left you in Edo?

01:08:57.488 --> 01:08:59.115
There may still be time.

01:08:59.574 --> 01:08:59.991
You should-

01:08:59.991 --> 01:09:00.992
I...
You should-

01:09:01.367 --> 01:09:03.995
want to remain by your side!

01:09:06.205 --> 01:09:08.041
Hakodate will soon fall.

01:09:09.250 --> 01:09:13.171
As the one who leads the Shinsengumi,

01:09:13.171 --> 01:09:15.590
| need to watch over this place until that time comes.

01:09:16.257 --> 01:09:18.468
Hijikata-san, that's how you always are.

01:09:19.469 --> 01:09:22.096
You take on everything by yourself,

01:09:22.096 --> 01:09:24.140
and you're the only one who suffers...

01:09:25.058 --> 01:09:27.060
That's my duty.

01:09:27.810 --> 01:09:30.188
If I can do something about it,

01:09:30.188 --> 01:09:32.398
then it's better if only I suffer.

01:09:33.149 --> 01:09:34.150
That's...

01:09:35.109 --> 01:09:38.946
That's why everyone worried about you, Hijikata-san.

01:09:39.322 --> 01:09:42.658
| came this far because
| was entrusted with those feelings.

01:09:44.994 --> 01:09:49.207
Do you still think of the Shinsengumi as
a guide for what a warrior should be?

01:09:50.249 --> 01:09:51.250
Yes!

01:09:52.126 --> 01:09:56.339
Do you think that I've been carrying on what they loved?

01:09:57.090 --> 01:09:58.091
Yes!

01:09:59.175 --> 01:10:00.385
| see...

01:10:01.302 --> 01:10:03.304
Your hardships and pains...

01:10:04.305 --> 01:10:06.933
From now on, please share a bit of them with me.

01:10:07.767 --> 01:10:10.395
If I can be your support, the please lean on me

01:10:11.104 --> 01:10:13.731
so you don't have to shoulder everything alone.

01:10:20.488 --> 01:10:23.324
| used to think that I wouldn't mind dying...

01:10:24.617 --> 01:10:27.036
once I fulfilled my duty to lead the Shinsengumi.

01:10:30.498 --> 01:10:34.710
However, I've gained a reason to not die so easily.

01:10:38.089 --> 01:10:40.716
I've fought desperately to protect many things.

01:10:41.217 --> 01:10:44.220
But now, the thing I want to protect most...

01:10:44.720 --> 01:10:46.722
is you, Chizuru.

01:10:48.391 --> 01:10:51.811
Ever since I said I would protect you...

01:10:52.478 --> 01:10:54.313
| must have fallen for you.

01:10:58.443 --> 01:11:00.862
Stay by my side forever.

01:11:01.737 --> 01:11:03.906
Even if you try to escape, I won't let go,

01:11:03.906 --> 01:11:05.324
so keep that in mind.

01:11:05.825 --> 01:11:06.826
Right!

01:11:32.393 --> 01:11:33.603
Vice Minister Hijikata!

01:11:34.187 --> 01:11:36.397
The supply line to Benten Fortress has been cut off!

01:11:36.898 --> 01:11:37.899
What did you say?!

01:11:38.483 --> 01:11:39.692
I'm going to offer my help!

01:11:40.693 --> 01:11:41.777
Prepare me a horse!

01:11:41.777 --> 01:11:42.403
Sir!

01:11:45.114 --> 01:11:46.115
Chizuru...

01:11:46.908 --> 01:11:47.909
you come too.

01:11:48.826 --> 01:11:49.660
Right!

01:11:56.709 --> 01:11:57.919
Fire!

01:11:58.419 --> 01:11:59.253
It's the enemy!

01:11:59.253 --> 01:12:00.254
Stop them!

01:12:00.254 --> 01:12:01.088
What?!

01:12:18.523 --> 01:12:19.732
Hijikata-san!

01:12:28.824 --> 01:12:30.618
Are you uninjured?

01:12:30.618 --> 01:12:31.619
I'm fine!

01:12:32.203 --> 01:12:33.412
Hijikata-san!

01:12:34.747 --> 01:12:36.165
Let's get away from here...

01:12:36.874 --> 01:12:38.376
and wait for my wounds to heal.

01:12:38.376 --> 01:12:39.377
Right!

01:12:46.300 --> 01:12:47.510
Hijikata-san...

01:12:47.802 --> 01:12:49.762
| don't sense any enemy soldiers,

01:12:49.762 --> 01:12:52.390
so you should be able to rest here,
at least for a little while.

01:12:52.974 --> 01:12:54.809
We need to use this chance to stop the bleeding.

01:12:57.103 --> 01:12:59.313
Yeah, please do.

01:13:04.277 --> 01:13:05.486
How terrible...

01:13:05.987 --> 01:13:07.238
Hijikata-san,

01:13:07.238 --> 01:13:11.242
as soon as you've recovered enough to move,
let's retreat back to Goryokaku.

01:13:15.413 --> 01:13:16.789
Hijikata-san?

01:13:16.789 --> 01:13:18.666
Hijikata-san, are you listening to me?!

01:13:18.666 --> 01:13:21.085
Yeah, I'm listening...

01:13:21.919 --> 01:13:23.129
It will be okay.

01:13:23.421 --> 01:13:26.424
Shimada-san and the others
won't go down without a fight.

01:13:27.091 --> 01:13:29.510
I'm sure they're waiting for us.

01:13:29.969 --> 01:13:31.596
Of course they are...

01:13:32.179 --> 01:13:35.182
The Shinsengumi's name isn't just for show.

01:13:40.396 --> 01:13:41.606
Hijikata-san!

01:13:42.106 --> 01:13:44.108
Can you hear me, Hijikata-san?!

01:13:46.402 --> 01:13:48.613
Don't shout, I can hear you...

01:13:49.655 --> 01:13:50.656
What should I do?/

01:13:51.157 --> 01:13:53.159
At this rate, Hijikata-san will...

01:14:01.500 --> 01:14:02.918
I won't..

01:14:03.419 --> 01:14:04.837
let you die!

01:14:09.258 --> 01:14:11.677
Please live...

01:14:13.679 --> 01:14:14.889
Hijikata-san/

01:14:19.393 --> 01:14:20.603
Hijikata-san...

01:14:22.104 --> 01:14:25.399
Did you hurt yourself?

01:14:26.567 --> 01:14:28.194
It will heal in no time.

01:14:29.487 --> 01:14:32.698
That's not the problem.

01:14:33.199 --> 01:14:37.036
What man would willingly make...

01:14:37.370 --> 01:14:40.206
the woman he loves feel pain?

01:14:40.581 --> 01:14:42.416
Consider my feelings a little, will you?

01:14:42.833 --> 01:14:47.838
Well, I don't want to see the man I love in pain, either.

01:14:49.048 --> 01:14:50.466
Shut up...

01:14:51.759 --> 01:14:53.969
Someone will notice we're here before much longer.

01:14:54.303 --> 01:14:56.722
Let's return to Goryokaku by the back route.

01:14:56.722 --> 01:14:57.723
Okay!

01:15:08.025 --> 01:15:09.235
How beautiful...

01:15:17.118 --> 01:15:20.329
You look good next to cherry blossoms.

01:15:21.414 --> 01:15:22.623
You think so?

01:15:23.582 --> 01:15:26.585
| think they look better with you, Hijikata-san.

01:15:27.712 --> 01:15:30.131
The first day we met back in the capital...

01:15:31.006 --> 01:15:36.637
You looked like stunning cherry blossoms to me.

01:15:38.639 --> 01:15:41.267
I'd like to see them with you from here on, too.

01:15:49.233 --> 01:15:52.069
So you're still alive.

01:15:52.528 --> 01:15:53.946
Kazama-san?

01:15:55.865 --> 01:15:59.869
You did well, making it here to the far north.

01:16:00.786 --> 01:16:04.415
| never thought you'd come all the way to Ezo.

01:16:05.666 --> 01:16:09.503
It would have been quite a waste of time
if I had already died.

01:16:10.171 --> 01:16:14.258
Furies are something that shouldn't exist in this world.

01:16:16.594 --> 01:16:20.222
| came here to wipe them out.

01:16:21.682 --> 01:16:22.892
Please don't do this!

01:16:23.309 --> 01:16:26.312
Hijikata-san is severely injured!

01:16:28.022 --> 01:16:30.649
If someone's willing to come this far for a fight,

01:16:31.150 --> 01:16:34.779
as a true warrior, I should accept the challenge.

01:16:35.029 --> 01:16:36.030
That's—

01:16:36.781 --> 01:16:37.990
I---

01:16:37.990 --> 01:16:40.409
| will fight for what I believed in.

01:16:40.993 --> 01:16:45.039
Chizuru, watch over me till the end.

01:16:48.542 --> 01:16:49.752
Very well.

01:16:56.550 --> 01:16:59.178
For what you believe in, huh?

01:16:59.678 --> 01:17:03.182
When you're neither human nor devil,

01:17:03.182 --> 01:17:05.392
what is it that you believe in and fight for?

01:17:06.268 --> 01:17:10.689
The more power you use, the shorter your life becomes,

01:17:10.689 --> 01:17:15.319
and though it extends your life,
the blood of others drives you mad.

01:17:15.820 --> 01:17:17.822
It is your fate to die.

01:17:19.740 --> 01:17:24.578
The way you rush through life,
you are just like the cherry blossoms.

01:17:27.206 --> 01:17:29.208
I'm not trying to rush through life!

01:17:30.084 --> 01:17:33.712
| just had a bunch of people who needed me!

01:18:12.376 --> 01:18:15.254
The name "fury" that belongs to those fakes

01:18:16.005 --> 01:18:21.510
does not match the way you live your life.

01:18:22.553 --> 01:18:25.556
You are already a devil.

01:18:26.181 --> 01:18:28.809
| shall bestow a devil name upon you.

01:18:30.019 --> 01:18:31.645
You are "Hakuoki."

01:18:32.354 --> 01:18:38.193
It's not like I've been fighting
to earn your recognition as a devil.

01:18:40.070 --> 01:18:41.906
| can't play for much longer.

01:18:42.531 --> 01:18:43.949
Is that okay?

01:18:44.742 --> 01:18:46.160
Naturally.

01:18:46.452 --> 01:18:48.871
| shall finish you off in one strike.

01:19:07.306 --> 01:19:10.517
To think that I would fall behind...

01:19:17.107 --> 01:19:18.108
Hijikata-san!

01:19:18.692 --> 01:19:19.902
Hijikata-san!

01:19:23.113 --> 01:19:25.532
Hang on, Hijikata-san!

01:19:35.000 --> 01:19:36.627
Hakuoki...

01:19:38.754 --> 01:19:43.968
I'll let you live out what little life you have left.

01:19:45.052 --> 01:19:48.263
Yeah, I'll live.

01:20:05.823 --> 01:20:08.575
Cineerity

01:20:19.545 --> 01:20:20.754
I'm sorry, but...

01:20:21.338 --> 01:20:23.173
<i>I can't go there just yet.</i>

01:20:25.217 --> 01:20:27.219
<i>I'll live together with her.</i>

01:20:29.513 --> 01:20:31.140
<i>So watch over us, okay?</i>

01:20:42.151 --> 01:20:48.699
If I look up at the dazzling sky
Mabayuki sora 0 aogeba soko ni

01:20:48.699 --> 01:20:55.164
There I see a brilliant trace
Miyuru azayaka na omokage

01:20:55.164 --> 01:21:02.546
Even now, it's not a memory
Omoide ja nai ima mo na o

01:21:02.546 --> 01:21:13.182
The fluttering flag is in my heart
Hatameku mihata wa kokoro ni

01:21:35.370 --> 01:21:39.792
Without ever hesitating
Tamerau koto mo sezu ni

01:21:42.002 --> 01:21:47.007
Like the cherry blossoms dancing down
Maichiru sakura ga gotoku

01:21:47.800 --> 01:21:51.678
The dark midday shadows
Kuraki mahiru no yami

01:21:51.678 --> 01:22:00.687
That day I hurriedly chased after that back
Isogu senaka otte ita ano hi

01:22:01.188 --> 01:22:07.986
It's without replacement, more than this life
Kono inochi yori kakegae no naki

01:22:07.986 --> 01:22:13.826
If you call this longing love
Omoi o ai to yobu no nara

01:22:14.535 --> 01:22:17.871
I'll forever love you to my fullest
Zutto aishinuku

01:22:17.871 --> 01:22:24.920
Ah, even if we can't meet
Aa aenaku natte mo

01:22:24.920 --> 01:22:27.131
Strongly
Tsuyoku

01:22:27.131 --> 01:22:33.971
Is the pure sky there?
Sayakeki sora yo soko ni imasu ka?

01:22:33.971 --> 01:22:40.394
Those far away, nostalgic people
Haruka natsukashiki hitotachi

01:22:40.394 --> 01:22:47.734
If I dry away my tears and call your name
Namida o fuite na o yobeba

01:22:47.734 --> 01:22:59.371
The gathered, lingering light
Tanabiku tsudoishi hikari ga

01:23:07.421 --> 01:23:12.259
What the scattering flowers leave behind
Chiriyuku hana ga nokosu

01:23:14.011 --> 01:23:18.849
Is like the seed of tomorrow
Ashita no tane no gotoku ni

01:23:19.933 --> 01:23:23.645
Grief for the disturbed era
Midaru jidai urei

01:23:23.645 --> 01:23:32.946
As though that galloping figure would be conveyed to the future
Kakeshi sugata tsutaeyou mirai he

01:23:32.946 --> 01:23:39.578
That will, that soul
Sono kokorozashi sono tamashii o

01:23:40.037 --> 01:23:46.043
| will definitely hand them down
Watashi ga kitto kataritsugu

01:23:46.627 --> 01:23:49.880
Right, even if I disappear
Itsuka kono yo kara

01:23:49.880 --> 01:23:57.012
From this world someday
Sou watashi ga kiete mo

01:23:57.012 --> 01:23:59.264
Through eternity
Towa ni

01:23:59.264 --> 01:24:06.021
If I look up at the neverending sky
Hatenaki sora o0 aogeba soko ni

01:24:06.021 --> 01:24:12.361
What's reflected are those precious days
Utsuru itooshiki ano hibi

01:24:12.361 --> 01:24:19.701
There will never be a goodbye
Sayonara wa nai tokoshie ni

01:24:19.701 --> 01:24:28.543
The living bonds are in my heart
Ikiteru kizuna wa kokoro ni

01:24:28.877 --> 01:24:32.214
This year as well
Kotoshi mo ryouran to

01:24:32.214 --> 01:24:38.428
The cherry blossoms bloom profusely in this country
Sakura saku kono kuni

01:24:38.804 --> 01:24:49.439
Like a momento of the day that flower fell
Ano hi sange shita hana no katami no you ni

01:24:49.439 --> 01:24:57.447
As though burning
Moyuru gotoku

01:25:24.725 --> 01:25:31.398
If I look up at the dazzling sky
Mabayuki sora 0 aogeba soko ni

01:25:31.398 --> 01:25:37.863
There I see a beloved trace
Miyuru shitawashiki omokage

01:25:37.863 --> 01:25:45.078
Even now, it's not a memory
Omoide ja nai ima mo na o

01:25:45.078 --> 01:25:52.294
The fluttering flag is...
Hatameku mihata wa

01:25:52.627 --> 01:25:59.468
If I look up at the neverending sky
Hatenaki sora o0 aogeba soko ni

01:25:59.468 --> 01:26:05.766
What's reflected are those precious days
Utsuru itooshiki ano hibi

01:26:05.766 --> 01:26:13.106
There will never be a goodbye
Sayonara wa nai tokoshie ni

01:26:13.106 --> 01:26:24.117
The living bonds are in my heart
Ikiteru kizuna wa kokoro ni

01:26:25.410 --> 01:26:31.416
In my heart
Kokoro ni
